<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to Feb 10 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	     Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     557	   16,167	2,866</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 59		239	  112</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    284		552	  161</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		410     18,298</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		 75	   11</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0		536	  113</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  1		 16	    6</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    235	    3,088	  513</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
